# SDD execution record. The task briefs, implementer reports and reviewer verdicts under
# .superpowers/sdd/ are the only account of WHY each task ended up the way it did — they were
# local-only scratch through Phase 3 and did not survive between machines, which HANDOFF §3 had
# to work around by hand. They are tracked from 2026-08-04 so they travel.
# The review-*.diff packages stay out: they are `git diff` between commits already in history.
.superpowers/*
!.superpowers/sdd/
.superpowers/sdd/**/*.diff

erp/node_modules/
erp/.next/
erp/.env
erp/coverage/

